JetSpec source attribution
==========================

This tree carries code from the following sources. The paths below identify
the copied or adapted portions; importing a dependency does not imply that its
source is distributed here.

PTD / causal_parallel_drafting — MIT
-----------------------------------
jetspec/methods/jetspec/draft_head.py vendors the DFlash attention, decoder and
draft-head classes from causal_parallel_drafting/model/dflash.py, plus helpers
from model/utils.py. See its provenance banner and the marked copied blocks.
jetspec/methods/jetspec/tree/ also ports tree construction, ancestor masks and
acceptance from causal_parallel_drafting/model/tree.py, as its banners state.
Copyright (c) 2026 Z Lab

vLLM — Apache License 2.0
-------------------------
jetspec/inference_engine/paged_tree_attn.py adapts kernel_unified_attention_2d
from vLLM's triton_unified_attention.py. The local banner describes the removed
features and retained online-softmax and query-bias code.
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project
Authors: Burkhard Ringlein, Jan van Lunteren, Chih-Chieh Yang, Thomas Parnell.
License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

JetSpec++ reference implementation — MIT
---------------------------------------
jetspec/methods/jetspec_plus_plus/ and the JetSpec++ hooks in jetspec/core/llm.py
are first-party code ported from the authors' JetSpec++ reference implementation,
under the MIT license.
Copyright (c) 2026 The Parallel Tree Decoding authors

DeepSpec — MIT
--------------
jetspec/engines/jetspec_plus_plus/third_party/blockhead_kit/markov.py copies the
Markov heads from deepspec/modeling/dspark/markov_head.py. head.py in the same
directory adapts the DSpark draft head, confidence head and sampling helpers
from deepspec/modeling/dspark/. Each file's banner states its source.
Copyright (c) 2026 The DeepSpec Authors

